30 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II id. Ap.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Communis IX</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">kl. Ap.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Communis X</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XII kl. Ap.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Biss. Emb. XI</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI id. Ap.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Communis XII</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V kl. Apr.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Communis XIII</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XVI kl. Apr.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Embol. XIV</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">non. Apr.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Bissext. XV</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IX kl. Apr.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Embol. XVI</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II id. Ap.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Sedecennitas</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">I</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">II</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III</C> <C N=6 INDENT=590 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV</C> <C N=7 INDENT=705 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">V</C> <C N=8 INDENT=820 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI</C> <C N=9 INDENT=935 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VII</C></R></TBL> 

Dies dominicus
proximesequens,
est Pascha Christianorum.</NOTE>  idus april. feria V. <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Et caetaque.</NOTE>  Ecce itaque, quomodo superius
computavimus quod <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  post.  <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  post, anno octavo, VIII kal. apr.,
 <HI REND="ITALIC">quod est suo calculo, supra a nobis recensito, conforme.</HI></NOTE>  post annos octo, V kal.
apr. iterum inventa est XV a luna. Sic <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  post, anno octavo, II id.</NOTE>  post annos
octo, pridie idus apr. inventa <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  est.</NOTE>  est XIV luna <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  sed feria non secunda, sed quinta,  <HI REND="ITALIC">omisso</HI>  quomodo
ante.  <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  non  <HI REND="ITALIC">et</HI>  ante.</NOTE>  et
feria non secunda quomodo ante, sed quinta est inventa.
Et ideo <NOTE N="f" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">W. sic suppleo. C.</HI>  non hunc eodem pinacem.  <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  hunc
eumdem pinacem.</NOTE>  XIV lunam, eodem pinace, <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  non per VIII sed decima diem,  <HI REND="ITALIC">pro</HI>  sed sedecim ad
diem.</NOTE>  non
per octo annos, sed per annos sedecim, ad diem
suum primum redire ostendimus; et <NOTE N="h" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  ideo.</NOTE>  in eo bissexti
annos <NOTE N="i" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  secundum cursum solis.</NOTE>  secundum cursum solis sine errore ignorantium
notavimus. Qui et ipse <NOTE N="j" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  XVI dec. annus suppletus. C. XVI ann. suppletus.</NOTE>  XVI annis suppletis
licet ad <NOTE N="k" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  coelum.</NOTE>  certum diem suum <NOTE N="l" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. C.</HI>  in embol.</NOTE>  immisso embolismo,
tum XIV luna occurrit <NOTE N="m" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. C. deest</HI>  tamen ad II feriam non occurrit.  <HI REND="ITALIC">R</HI>  tamen
ad secunda feria non occurrit sed ad prima.</NOTE>  tamen ad secundam feriam
non occurrit, sed ad primam. Sic aeque secunda sedecennitas
 <NOTE N="n" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  supplet occurrat.</NOTE>  suppleta occurrit ad septimam feriam. <NOTE N="o" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  Tertiae vero feria VI, Quarta autem feria V.</NOTE>  Tertia
vero, feria sexta. Quarta autem, feria quinta. Quinta
 <COL N="0951B"></COL> <NOTE N="p" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  sedecennitas ostendit fer.</NOTE>  sedecennitas, <NOTE N="q" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">deest</HI>  feria IV sexta sedecennitas.</NOTE>  feria quarta. Sexta <NOTE N="r" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0951" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0951C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  decennitas.</NOTE>  sedecennitas,
feria quarta. <NOTE N="s" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  septimplum tempus cum impleverit annus.</NOTE>  Septima autem, cum suppleverit annos
 <COL N="0952A"></COL> CXII, revertitur ad <NOTE N="t" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  pridie idus.</NOTE>  II id. apr. et <NOTE N="u" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  venit.</NOTE>  invenitur
 <NOTE N="v" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  luna quartadecima et secunda feria.</NOTE>  luna XIV, et feria II.</P> <P COM="0952">Hi ergo sunt anni <NOTE N="x" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  CXII in.  <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  gyrantis, et ad diem primum Paschae
observatae in Aegypto computantes annos.</NOTE>  CXII in quibus gyrantes,
et a <NOTE N="y" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  a.</NOTE>  primo die Paschae observato in Aegypto annos
computantes, usque ad Christum <NOTE N="z" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  perveniemus.</NOTE>  pervenimus, et
diem passionis <NOTE N="aa" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  et resurrectionis.</NOTE>  et resurrectionis ejus ostendimus.</P> <P COM="0952"><NOTE N="bb" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  primo ut reliquus annus VIII pinaces.</NOTE>  Prius est tamen ut reliquos annos octo pinacis,
demonstremus, usque in octavum enim computavimus.
Nono itaque anno <NOTE N="cc" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  commune.</NOTE>  communi, XIV luna,
et II feria occurrit kal. apr. Item, decimo <NOTE N="dd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  anno.</NOTE>  anno
communi, XII kal. apr. sexta feria. Undecimo anno,
 <NOTE N="ee" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  bissextum et embolismo.  <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  bissextum et embolismus.</NOTE>  bissextus et embolismus, VI id. apr. <NOTE N="ff" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  IV.</NOTE>  quinta
feria. Duodecimo anno communi, <NOTE N="gg" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  quintam kl.</NOTE>  V kal. Apr.
secunda feria. <NOTE N="hh" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  XIV.</NOTE>  Tertiodecimo anno item communi
 <NOTE N="ii" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  XIII.</NOTE>  XVI kal. apr. <NOTE N="jj" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  feria sexta.</NOTE>  sexta feria. Quartodecimo <NOTE N="kk" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  anno.</NOTE>  anno,
 <COL N="0952B"></COL> <NOTE N="ll" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  embolismo.</NOTE>  embolismus non. apr. quinta feria. <NOTE N="mm" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0952" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0952C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  XII anno bis sextum nonum kal. apr. secunda
feria.</NOTE>  Quintodecimo
anno bissext. communi, XIV kal. apr. secunda feria.
 <COL N="0953A"></COL> <NOTE TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES ED="Dodwellus, Henricus" COM="0953"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <P COM="0953"><HI REND="ITALIC">Pascha kal.</HI>  Nempe tertiae sedecennitatis anno
nono.</P> 
 <P COM="0953"><HI REND="ITALIC">Pascha</HI>  VI. Nempe, post integrum pinacem (annorum
112) septies transactum (seu annos 784),
anno octavi pinacis 83, hoc est sextae sedecennitatis
anno tertio.</P> 

 <P COM="0953"><HI REND="ITALIC">Pascha</HI>  XII. Nempe post 8 pinaces, anno
74 sequentis, seu quintae sedecennitatis anno decimo.</P> 

 <P COM="0953"><HI REND="ITALIC">Pascha</HI>  XII. Nempe, post pinaces 9, anno 106
 <COL N="0953D"></COL> sequentis, hoc est ultimae sedecennitatis anno decimo.
Numerat autem, ut infra patet, ab Exodo ad
captivitatem Jechoniae annos 995; hinc ad edictum
Cyri, annos 70; hinc ad finem septem hebdomadum,
49; qui fiunt 1114.</P> 

 <P COM="0953"><HI REND="ITALIC">Sed et ipse Jesus.</HI>  G. Locus laudatus a Bucherio.</P> 

 <P COM="0953"><HI REND="ITALIC">Pascha</HI>  VI. Nempe, post pinaces 14, anno 11 sequentis.
Estque locus hic, sed depravatus, quem
citat, ex Bucherio, Seneschallus: qui confirmat
calculi correctionem, quam ante posueram. Nempe
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Usserius</HI>  jam ante, pro I DLXXIV (ubi V exciderat),
restituerat 1579, quod ex annorum omnium computatione,
infra sequente, faciendum constat: indeque ex
 <COL N="0954C"></COL> pinace, diem restitueram, ut vides. Quam correctionem
confirmat codex R.</P> 

 <P COM="0954"><HI REND="ITALIC">Suos</HI>  CCCXVIII. Locus hic in utroque codice
mancus est, adeoque obscurus; sed ad hunc sensum
restituendum esse, ex sequentibus liquet; nempe
cum Abraham adversarios expugnavit et liberavit
amicos  <CITN>(Gen. XIV)</CITN> , numeravit vernaculos, hoc est famulos
suos CCCXVIII. Quo contineri sentit hic auctor
haec mysteria prophetica; nimirum, per C centenarii
notam, signari, Abrahae centenario natum iri filium
 <COL N="0954D"></COL> Isaac; quam litteram triplicavit (CCC) pro centenariis
tribus prout tribus diebus iter fecit immolandus
Isaac (Christi typus), qui et gestavit lignum,
id est crucis signum; estque signum crucis  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>t</FOREIGN>  littera
graeca, notans numerum CCC. Sed praeter hos trecentos,
adjungit porro XVIII, hoc est, litteris graecis,
 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ih</FOREIGN> , quibus signari putat, utpote litteris initialibus,
 <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>1Ihsouðû</FOREIGN> , nomen Jesu. Adeoque, sicut per Abrahae
famulos CCCXVIII, liberatus est Loth, ita per  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>tih</FOREIGN> 
(quibus idem numerus signatur), id est per signum
crucis et nomen Jesu, liberatus est Isaac,
mortemque evacuavit seu evitavit illo die tertio.
Quae omnia non tam Isaac ultimo spectant, in
quo misericordiam consequitur nemo, sed, cujus
ille typus erat, Jesum Christum  <HI REND="ITALIC">semen Abrahae</HI> 
dictum.</P></NOTE>  Sextodecimo anno, facto embolismo, inventa
est <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  igitur.</NOTE>  iterum ad caput, id est in primo versu, luna
 <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  XVII  <HI REND="ITALIC">et infra</HI>  II id. April.</NOTE>  XIV, et prima feria, pridie id. April. in
quo die diximus Judaeos in Aegypto <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  primo.</NOTE>  primum observasse
Pascha.</P> <P COM="0953">Unde usque ad Jesum filium Nave, <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  anni XLI suppleti.</NOTE>  annis XLI
suppletis, immolaverunt filii Israel Pascha kal.
Apr. <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  sabbatis.</NOTE>  sabbato. Ezechias autem <NOTE N="f" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">W. sic suppleo. C. R.</HI>  ab Aegypto,</NOTE>  ab exitu ex Aegypto
usque <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  ad.</NOTE>  in primum annum regni sui, post annos
 <NOTE N="h" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  DCCCLXVIII.</NOTE>  DCCCLXVII, celebravit Pascha VI id. apr. <NOTE N="i" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  III.</NOTE>  IV
feria. Item Josias duodevicesimo anno regni sui,
post annos <NOTE N="j" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  DCCCLXX.</NOTE>  DCCCCLXX immolavit Pascha <NOTE N="k" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  XVII.</NOTE>  XII
kal. aprilis, feria II. <NOTE N="l" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Hesdra.</NOTE>  Esdras autem <NOTE N="m" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  eodem.</NOTE>  eo tempore
 <NOTE N="n" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  quod suppleti sunt hebdomada a tempore est.</NOTE>  quo suppletae sunt <NOTE N="o" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">W. sic emendo. R.</HI>  VI.</NOTE>  septem hebdomadae, <NOTE N="p" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  a.</NOTE>  a templo
restituto et perfecto et <NOTE N="q" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  civitatem restitutam.</NOTE>  restituta civitate Hierusalem,
 <COL N="0953B"></COL> post annos <NOTE N="r" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  CC DLXXVIII,  <HI REND="ITALIC">sed</HI>  CC  <HI REND="ITALIC">est pro</HI>   <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0040953A" TEXT="[Symbol]"></ORNAMENT> .</NOTE>  I CXIV, sacrificavit Pascha
XII kal. apr. sabbato. Sed et ipse Jesus Dominus
 <NOTE N="s" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  et.</NOTE>  et Salvator noster, post annos <NOTE N="t" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  I DLXXIV,  <HI REND="ITALIC">excidente</HI>  V.</NOTE>  I DLXXIII <NOTE N="u" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0953" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0953C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">U.</HI>  I DLXXIX.  <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  CC DLXXVIX, cum discentibus suis.</NOTE> 
cum discipulis suis manducavit Pascha <NOTE N="v" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. manifesto mendo,</HI>  IX kal.</NOTE>  VI id.
april. V feria: et passus est altera die, <NOTE N="x" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  VIII kal.</NOTE>  V id.
april. VI feria.</P> <P COM="0953"><COL N="0954A"></COL> Hic est Christus Jesus qui, secundum carnem,
Abrahae fuit filius; in cujus mysterio, <NOTE N="y" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  centenario.</NOTE>  centenario
patri natus Isaac super humeros suos portavit lignum:
ut ex <NOTE N="z" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  eodem monstr.</NOTE>  eo demonstraretur, <NOTE N="aa" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  adversario sexu repugnari.</NOTE>  et adversarios
expugnari, et credentes salutem consequi per lignum,
id est per <NOTE N="bb" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  crucis † in signum.</NOTE>  crucis signum. Ipse est Abraham,
cui dixit Deus: «In semine tuo benedicentur <NOTE N="cc" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. inserit</HI>  in te.</NOTE>  omnes
nationes terrae.» Numquid ergo <NOTE N="dd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Aliqui.</NOTE>  aliquis in Isaac
misericordiam consequitur? Non; sed <NOTE N="ee" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  omnes.</NOTE>  omnis homo
credens Deo in Christo <NOTE N="ff" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  benedicentur.</NOTE>  benedicetur. Et ideo
Abraham, quia <NOTE N="gg" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  de Domino.</NOTE>  a Deo Domino dictus est propheta,
cum <NOTE N="hh" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  manifesta.</NOTE>  manifeste sciret, in sacramento Christi, centenario
sibi <NOTE N="ii" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  nato filio.</NOTE>  natum filium, qui post diem tertium
mortem evacuavit, et illum fortem <NOTE N="jj" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  et.</NOTE>  et inimicum
nostrum vinxit: <NOTE N="kk" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">W. sic suppleo, quod in mss. mancum est. C.</HI>  deinde
numeravit universos vernaculos suos, centenaria generatione
triplicavit et fecit signum crucis quibus adjunxit nomine
Jesu.  <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  denumeravit universos vernas suos, et
propter centenariam nativitatem triplicavit centum et fecit
signum † quibus et adjecit XVIII in nomine huius.</NOTE>  deinde numeravit universos vernaculos
 <COL N="0954B"></COL> suos CCCXVIII, id est pro centenaria generatione
triplicavit C, et fecit  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>t</FOREIGN>  signum crucis, quibus
adjunxit  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>ih</FOREIGN>  nomen Jesu, et adversarios expugnavit,
et filium fratris sui Loth de <NOTE N="ll" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  servitute lib.</NOTE>  captivitate eorum liberavit.
Et merito ipse Dominus et magister noster
dicebat Judaeis: « <NOTE N="mm" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0954" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0954C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  si filii Abrahae estis, facta patris vestri facite.</NOTE>  Si filii Abrahae essetis, facta
 <COL N="0955A"></COL> <NOTE TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES ED="Dodwellus, Henricus" COM="0955"><COL N="0955D"></COL> <P COM="0955"><HI REND="ITALIC">Annis</HI>  VIII. Retineo Athaliae (quam Godoliam vocat
uterque codex) annos 8 (utut nunc 6, nunc 7, memorentur
II Chron. 22, 12 et 23, 1 et 24, 1 et alibi),
quoniam hoc exigere videtur hujus calculus; atque
alii chronologi saltem 7 numerant; et uterque codex
consentit.</P> 

 <P COM="0955"><HI REND="ITALIC">Ab Exodo autem</HI>  DCCCCLXXXXV. Numeros, passim
 <COL N="0956D"></COL> vitiosos, restituimus ex S. Scripturae locis, quos
respiciunt. Atque, sic emendati, exhibent (quem ille
vult) numerum 995. Numeratis, scilicet, Davidis 6
mensibus, et Joachazi tribus, et Jechoniae tribus
mensibus cum decem diebus (pro quibus poni hic
100 dies) pro uno anno integro.</P></NOTE>  Abrahae faceretis.» <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Et.</NOTE>  At illi itaque qui haec a Christo
audierunt non <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Abraham.</NOTE>  Abrahae sed diaboli facta iniqua
facere elegerunt. <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955B"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Haec.</NOTE>  Ac propterea, Gentes, <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">W. sic suppleo. C.</HI>  facti estis patris suae Abrahae facientes,
cum signum crucis et nomine Jesu, sermone Dei
armati, quotidianis diebus adversus angelos apostatas pugnantes
qui de capt.  <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  facta patris sui Abrahae facientes
cum signum crucis et nomen hominis quotidianis diebus
adversus angelos apostaticos expugnantes, sermone Dei
armati, de captivitate Satanae liberant homines.</NOTE>  facti estis
filii Abrahae, facta patris sui Abrahae facientes,
cum signo crucis et nomine Jesu, quotidianis diebus
adversus angelos apostatas pugnantes, sermone Dei
armati, qui de captivitate Satanae liberat homines.
Ipse est Abraham qui LXXV annorum credidit vocatus;
et quamvis <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  in multos.</NOTE>  multos, id est tamquam stellas
coeli, filios <NOTE N="f" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Abrahae.</NOTE>  habere ab ipso Deo <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  det.</NOTE>  sit praedictus;
 <NOTE N="h" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  tam.</NOTE>  tamen per unicum filium ejus, cujus imaginem
portabat ille agnus immaculatus in Aegypto occisus,
et ipse protoplastus Adam et omnis homo credens
misericordiam <NOTE N="i" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  a Deo.</NOTE>  a Deo est consecutus.</P> <P COM="0955">Denique revertamur ad Exodum, id est ad diem <NOTE N="j" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Pascha I exinde.</NOTE> 
 <COL N="0955B"></COL> Paschae primum, et exinde per ordinem dinumeremus
 <NOTE N="k" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  annos.</NOTE>  annos usque ad Christum. In quibus annis
inveniemus nobis magna et <NOTE N="l" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  admirabilia.</NOTE>  admiranda sacramenta
demonstrari. <NOTE N="m" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  numerantes.</NOTE>  Dinumerantes itaque <NOTE N="n" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  ut dixi.</NOTE> , ut dixi,
per ordinem, <NOTE N="o" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  de.</NOTE>  a die quo exierunt ex Aegypto usque
ad diem quo oportebat eos exire de <NOTE N="p" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  heremo  <HI REND="ITALIC">bis.</HI></NOTE>  eremo, anni XL:
exeuntes autem de eremo et introeuntes <NOTE N="q" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0955" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0955C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  et possidentes.</NOTE>  ut possiderent
