 <NOTE N="yy" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0956" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0956C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  DCV,  <HI REND="ITALIC">sed calculus postulat</HI>  DV.</NOTE>  DV. Ab Exodo autem DCCCCLXXXXV. Et
