 <COL N="0956B"></COL> Hierusalem <NOTE N="bbb" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0956" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0956C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Sedechiam.</NOTE>  Sedeciam regem Juda, quem <NOTE N="ccc" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0956" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0956C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  per.</NOTE>  post
XI annos expugnavit, et filios ejus ante oculos ipsius
interfecit; et sic ipsum <NOTE N="ddd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0956" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0956C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Sedechiam inorbavit.</NOTE>  Sedeciam orbavit, et
