per Ezechielem Prophetam: « <NOTE N="ggg" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0956" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0956D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  et ext.</NOTE>  Extendam <NOTE N="hhh" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0956" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0956D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Sic uterque codex.</HI></NOTE>  retiam
meam super eum, et comprehendetur in conclusione,
et adducam eum in Babylonem <NOTE N="iii" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0956" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0956D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  et in.</NOTE>  in terra Chaldaeorum
et istam terram non videbit, et illic morietur.»
Similiter et <NOTE N="jjj" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0956" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0956D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Jeremias,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et deest</HI>  propheta.</NOTE>  Hieremias propheta de eo et
universo populo ejus prophetavit, dicens: «Haec dicit
 <COL N="0957A"></COL> <NOTE TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES ED="Dodwellus, Henricus" COM="0957"><COL N="0957"></COL> <P COM="0957"><HI REND="ITALIC">Darius Cyri filius. W.</HI>  id- est gener, ut cui nupserat Atossa, Cyri filia.</P></NOTE>  Dominus: Sic tradam <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. addit</HI>  Sedechiam.</NOTE>  regem Juda, et principes
 <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  ejus.</NOTE>  ejus, et residuos <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  in.</NOTE>  in Hierusalem, qui derelicti
sunt in terram istam, et eos qui <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  inhabitant in.</NOTE>  habitant
in Aegypto; et dabo eos in <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  dissipationem.</NOTE>  dispersionem in
omnia regna terrae, et in opprobrium, et in parabolam,
et in odium, et in execrationem, <NOTE N="f" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  et in locum ubi.</NOTE>  in
omni loco quo eos expulero; et <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  mittam.</NOTE>  immittam in eos
famem, et mortem, et gladium, donec deficiant a
terra quam dedi eis.»</P> <P COM="0957"><NOTE N="h" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  XI itaque annis suppleti sunt Ezechiae ab Exodo
anni  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0040957A" TEXT="[Symbol]"></ORNAMENT>  VI ut et.</NOTE>  Undecimo itaque anno Sedeciae <NOTE N="i" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Suppletae.</NOTE>  suppleti sunt
ab Exodo <NOTE N="j" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  anni.</NOTE>  anni mille et sex. Et tunc populus Judaeorum,
qui legem non observaverat, sed potius
contra voluntatem Dei filios suos idolis immolaverat,
et ipse captivus <NOTE N="k" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  agetur.</NOTE>  agitur; et civitas eorum quae synagogae
 <NOTE N="l" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  portabat.</NOTE>  portaverat typum succensa ab adversariis <NOTE N="m" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  traditur.</NOTE>  eradicatur;
 <COL N="0957B"></COL> et templum illud quod in mysterio Adae
fuerat fabricatum, et ipsum a fundamentis <NOTE N="n" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  subvertetur ad planum redigetur.</NOTE>  subvertitur,
et ad planum redigitur. Et sic nobis <NOTE N="o" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  qui.</NOTE>  qui in novissimis
diebus credere praevidebamur, magnum, ut
dixi, sacramentum demonstrabatur. Etenim, <NOTE N="p" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  sic.</NOTE>  si meruerat
ipse populus et civitas exterminari, <NOTE N="q" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  quod.</NOTE>  quid
templum Dei <NOTE N="r" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  amiserat.</NOTE>  admiserat ut hoc pateretur? nisi quia
vere constat <NOTE N="s" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">W. sic restituo. Uterque codex,</HI>  eum.</NOTE>  id factum, ut <NOTE N="t" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  dixit.</NOTE>  dixi, in mysterio ejus
qui prior <NOTE N="u" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  legis.</NOTE>  legem Dei transgressus est, et fuit pater
omnium peccatorum: et <NOTE N="v" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  odio.</NOTE>  ideo non <NOTE N="x" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  solo.</NOTE>  solum Adae
oportebat <NOTE N="y" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  subvenire.</NOTE>  subveniri, sed et omnibus peccatoribus
qui filii <NOTE N="z" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  fidei.</NOTE>  fidei Abrahae futuri praevidebantur, merito
et ipsi civitati et templo priusquam <NOTE N="aa" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  subverterentur.</NOTE>  subverteretur,
post annos LXX restituto, repromittebatur. Et hoc
erat quod jam <NOTE N="bb" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  tunc.</NOTE>  tunc ab initio saeculi in Abraham
 <COL N="0957C"></COL> patrem fidei demonstrabatur: qui cum supplesset a
die nativitatis suae annos LXX, non potuit de terra
sua exire, nisi in <NOTE N="cc" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  similitudine.</NOTE>  signo Pentateuchi, cujus universa
mandata populus Israel non erat observaturus,
 <COL N="0958A"></COL> adjicerentur et anni V, et sic credens Deo, <NOTE N="dd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  deputaretur ei justitia.</NOTE>  reputaretur
ei justitiam. Hic est itaque Abraham de
quo superius diximus, quod LXXV annorum <NOTE N="ee" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  credens.</NOTE>  crediderit
vocatus. Ad quos LXXV annos adjicitur
unus annus, et fiunt LXXVI. Quis autem hic qui adjicitur
 <NOTE N="ff" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0957" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0957D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  unus.</NOTE>  annus? Ille scilicet qui de semine ejus agnus
anniculus <NOTE N="gg" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Immolatus est. Dictus.</NOTE>  immaculatus est dictus. <NOTE N="hh" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  legitur  <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0040958A" TEXT="[Symbol]"></ORNAMENT>  VI.</NOTE>  Igitur, de mille
et sex deducamus LXXVI, et remanent anni
DCCCCXXX; quibus suppletis, Adam functus est
 <NOTE N="ii" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  vitam.</NOTE>  vita.</P> <P COM="0958">Post haec autem demonstremus captivitatis tempus,
annorum LXX. Suppletis enim ab Exodo usque
ad Jechoniam <NOTE N="jj" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  anni.</NOTE>  annis DCCCCLXXXXV, adjiciamus
 <NOTE N="kk" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  XL,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et deest</HI>  Sedechiae.</NOTE>  XI Sedeciae, qui anni undecim in corpore LXX
annorum computantur. <NOTE N="ll" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Qui.</NOTE>  Quo autem modo videamus.
 <COL N="0958B"></COL> Ex quo capta est <NOTE N="mm" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Hyerusalem,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et sic saepe.</HI></NOTE>  Hierusalem, ipse <NOTE N="nn" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Sedechias,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et sic semper. C. semper</HI>  Sedecias.</NOTE>  Sedecias,
 <NOTE N="oo" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  ut diximus.</NOTE>  ut diximus, annis XI. <NOTE N="pp" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Cujus post mortem postquam Nab.</NOTE>  Post quem Nabuchodonosor,
qui eum in terra Chaldaeorum vinctum duxit,
 <NOTE N="qq" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  anni.</NOTE>  annis XXV. <NOTE N="rr" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  vitae Marodat.</NOTE>  Ulemaradan, annis <NOTE N="ss" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  XI.</NOTE>  XII. <NOTE N="tt" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Baldasar.</NOTE>  Balthasar
annis IV. Et Darius <NOTE N="uu" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Asiriae.</NOTE>  Cyri filius, annis XVIII.
 <NOTE N="vv" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  sunt.</NOTE>  Fiunt in se anni LXX. Et sic Cyrus <NOTE N="xx" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  suscipit.</NOTE>  suscepit
regnum Medorum et Persarum.</P> <P COM="0958">Ipse est Cyrus cujus in principio regni, cum thesauris
