in terra sua. <NOTE N="aaa" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Ex ipso enim.</NOTE>  Ex quo tempore oportet nos
