meminimus <NOTE N="ccc" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Danielo.</NOTE>  Danieli dixisse: «LXX <NOTE N="ddd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0958" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0958D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  hebdomadae.</NOTE>  hebdomades
