 <NOTE N="f" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  sed.</NOTE>  Et <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  confirmavit.</NOTE>  confirmabit testamentum multis hebdomas
