 <NOTE N="q" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Danielo.  <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  a Daniele.</NOTE>  Danieli dixisse: « <NOTE N="r" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  et confirmavit.</NOTE>  Confirmabit testamentum
multis hebdomas una. Et in dimidio, inquit, hebdomadis
auferetur meum sacrificium et libatio.» Dimidium
autem hebdomadis, tempus et tempora et
dimidium temporis ostendit: quod est triennium et
menses sex; <NOTE N="s" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  quis dies.</NOTE>  qui fiunt dies, secundum <NOTE N="t" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Apocalypsi in.</NOTE>  Apocalypsin,
mille CCLX. In quibus diebus ille Antichristus
magnam faciet vastationem: et ideo tunc nemo Christianorum
poterit Deo sacrificium offerre, quoniam
 <COL N="0959C"></COL> ipse <NOTE N="u" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Antichristus.</NOTE>  nequissimus incipiet in templo Dei <NOTE N="v" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  consedere.</NOTE>  sedere,
et ignorantibus <NOTE N="x" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Dominum se affirm.</NOTE>  se Deum affirmare: quem oportet
Jesum <NOTE N="y" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Christum et.</NOTE>  Dominum et Salvatorem nostrum spiritu oris
sui interficere, et praesentia adventus sui evacuare,
et in ipso mundum consummare, sicut scriptum est.
 <COL N="0960A"></COL> «Et super illud sanctum execratio <NOTE N="z" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0959" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0959D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  vastationis.</NOTE>  vastationum, et
usque ad consummationem temporis consummatio
