hebdomadas. Quae septem hebdomadae continent
annos XLIX; quibus suppletis, illo in tempore et
Hierusalem restituta cognoscebatur, et platea per
medium ejus aedificata considerabatur, murus in circuitu
civitatis ipsius erectus, illa omnia quae intus
erant fortiter <NOTE N="dd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  tuebantur.</NOTE>  tuebatur. In qua civitate templum
illud quod in <NOTE N="ee" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  similitudinem.</NOTE>  similitudine Adae fuerat destructum;
in <NOTE N="ff" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  omine.</NOTE>  nomine ejus iterum <NOTE N="gg" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  per XLV annos est aedificatum.</NOTE>  per XLVI annos est aedificatum,
et in <NOTE N="hh" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  sacramentum.</NOTE>  sacramento Spiritus sancti oleo est
unctum; quomodo ab Angelo fuerat dictum. Ut
 <NOTE N="ii" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  consummaretur.</NOTE>  consummetur visio et <NOTE N="jj" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  prophetiae.  <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  propheta.</NOTE>  prophetia et <NOTE N="kk" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  ungeatur.</NOTE>  ungueatur
 <COL N="0960B"></COL> <NOTE N="ll" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  sanctus.</NOTE>  sanctum sanctorum. <NOTE N="mm" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Sic rescribo, sed C. et R.</HI>  ipsud.</NOTE>  Ipsum autem fuit sanctum
