 <COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  quem exponimus.  <HI REND="ITALIC">W. rescribo</HI>  quod.</NOTE>  Sic fuerat enim in eodem capitulo
quod exponimus scriptum, «et post <NOTE N="qq" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  LXXII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  LXX et una.</NOTE>  LXII hebdomadas
 <NOTE N="rr" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  peribit.</NOTE>  disperibit unctio, et judicium non est in
eo, et civitatem et illud sanctum corrumpet cum
illo duce qui veniet, <NOTE N="ss" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  et.</NOTE>  et excidentur <NOTE N="tt" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  in.</NOTE>  in cataclysmo,
 <NOTE N="uu" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  et.</NOTE>  et usque ad finem belli breviati <NOTE N="vv" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  ex terminis.</NOTE>  exterminii. Excidentur,
 <NOTE N="xx" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  in quid in cataclismo diluvii.</NOTE>  inquit, in cataclysmo.» De quibus hoc
 <NOTE N="yy" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  dicitur.</NOTE>  dixit? Utique de ipsis Judaeis, qui, post adventum
Christi, <NOTE N="zz" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  in.</NOTE>  in illa <NOTE N="aaa" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  ob seditione.</NOTE>  obsidione et <NOTE N="bbb" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  pugnatione.</NOTE>  expugnatione Vespasiani
excisi et ejecti sunt de civitate sua, in qua
jam non redeunt nec <NOTE N="ccc" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  in.</NOTE>  in ipsa fine belli breviati.
 <COL N="0960C"></COL> <NOTE N="ddd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Quod autem et in hoc.</NOTE>  Quod estautem <NOTE N="eee" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  hoc.</NOTE>  hoc bellum breviatum? nisi Antichristi
regnum quod exsurgere habet contra populum
