 <NOTE N="ggg" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0960" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0960D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Deus.</NOTE>  Dominus in Evangelio: «Et nisi abbreviati essent
dies illi, non liberaretur omnis caro.»</P> <P COM="0960"><COL N="0961A"></COL> Restitutum est <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  igitur.</NOTE>  ergo templum in nomine protoplasti,
qui dictus est Adam, sicut <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  supra.</NOTE>  superius diximus,
 <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  post annos XXX et VI.</NOTE>  annis XLVI. Sic autem ostenditur in nomine
Adam: cum apud Graecos prima littera nominis ejus
 <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  dicitur a alfamia, secunda autem delta, tesseres
tertia, iterum alfamia, et quarta mi tessera conta.</NOTE>  dicatur alpha  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>miva</FOREIGN> , secunda autem delta <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>tevssara</FOREIGN> .</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>tevssareû</FOREIGN> ,
iterum alpha  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>miva</FOREIGN> , quarta my  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>tessaravkonta</FOREIGN> , <NOTE N="f" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  sic.</NOTE>  et fit numerus
sex et quadraginta. Qui numerus annorum sic
 <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  comprehenditur.</NOTE>  comprehendetur. Cum <NOTE N="h" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  adjecto illo.</NOTE>  a die illo quo reversus est
in terra sua Judaeorum populus, regnavit Cyrus
Persarum annis XXXI: post quem <NOTE N="i" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961C"></COL> Meabesses.</NOTE>  Cambyses annis
IX, et impleti sunt XXXX. Post annos autem
XL, regnat <NOTE N="j" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Sic rescribo. R.</HI>  Zmeridius.  <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Hysmerius.</NOTE>  Smerdis Magus mensibus <NOTE N="k" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  VI.</NOTE>  septem;
qui menses a nobis non computantur; <NOTE N="l" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  quare?</NOTE>  quare?
quoniam in septimo mense Cyri fundamenta templi
 <NOTE N="m" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  posuerat.</NOTE>  posuerunt, <NOTE N="n" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  eum.</NOTE>  et exinde usque ad annum secundum
 <COL N="0961B"></COL> Darii opus <NOTE N="o" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  in.</NOTE>  in eo non <NOTE N="p" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  fecerat.</NOTE>  confecerunt. Tunc prophetant
Aggaeus et Zacharias; per quos exhortatus est
eos Dominus, et unanimes accesserunt, et in quadriennio
residuum opus templi consummaverunt.
Quod ipsum quidem in primo libro <NOTE N="q" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Hesdrae.</NOTE>  Esdrae manifeste
demonstratur, quod sexto anno Darii templum
Dei <NOTE N="r" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  per omnia sit.</NOTE>  sit per omnia consummatum. Ad XL adjiciamus
 <NOTE N="s" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  Darii.</NOTE>  Darii VI, et fiunt XL et VI. Quibus annis
adjecti sunt tres in mysterio passionis et resurrectionis
Christi, et impleta est <NOTE N="t" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  hebdomades.</NOTE>  hebdomada septima.
Et tunc <NOTE N="u" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  plateas.</NOTE>  platea et templum et murus et ipsa civitas,
quadragesimo et nono anno suppleto, per omnia
perfecta et <NOTE N="v" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  protecta.</NOTE>  munita demonstrabatur. Sed hoc
totum opus in sacramento Ecclesiae perficiebatur.</P> <P COM="0961">Denique videamus quid ipsi XLIX anni significent.
 <COL N="0961C"></COL> Non sine causa enim Deus voluit in septem <NOTE N="x" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  hebdomadas.</NOTE>  hebdomadibus
tam magnum, id est <NOTE N="y" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  perfectum.</NOTE>  propheticum opus
 <NOTE N="z" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  consommari,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et sic saepe.</HI></NOTE>  consummari. Hoc autem <NOTE N="aa" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  modo.</NOTE>  modo <NOTE N="bb" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0961" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0961D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  perfectum.</NOTE>  propheticum
fuisse <NOTE N="cc" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  igitur.</NOTE>  intelligitur: cum de XLIX annis, in nomine
Jesu Christi, decem et octo <NOTE N="dd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  congregantur.</NOTE>  segregantur, et
remanent XXXI: quibus suppletis, Christus Jesus
propter credentium salutem passus est et resurrexit,
et per semetipsum omnia perfecta ostendit; et templum
 <COL N="0962A"></COL> quod non humanis sed suis sacris manibus,
 <NOTE N="ee" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  ob imperio.</NOTE>  secundum imperium Patris sui, <NOTE N="ff" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  plasmavit.</NOTE>  formavit, non oleo
sed spiritu Dei unxit; et civitatem, id est Ecclesiam,
lapidibus sanctificatis aedificavit, et in ipsa <NOTE N="gg" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  plateam constituit.</NOTE>  plateam
constituit. Platea autem est via recta <NOTE N="hh" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  et plana.</NOTE>  et plana, in
qua ambulantes perveniunt ad vitam aeternam. Huic
civitati fortem et inexpugnabilem murum, id est
sanctum nomen suum, constituit: per quod nomen
omnes adversarios pedibus ejus subjicit. <NOTE N="ii" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  et ecce.</NOTE>  Ecce,
Dei gratia, quam praeclara et admirabilia <NOTE N="jj" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. inserit</HI>  nobilia.</NOTE>  nobis
ostensa sunt per annos XLIX. Qui <NOTE N="kk" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  animae cont.</NOTE>  anni e contrario
infidelibus, et persecutionem servis Dei facientibus,
magnam demonstrant superventuram calamitatem.
 <NOTE N="ll" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  quia autem rationem.</NOTE>  Qua autem ratione videamus. Hic
 <NOTE N="mm" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  etenim.</NOTE>  enim mundus in quo justi et injusti <NOTE N="nn" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  habitatione.</NOTE>  ab initio saeculi
 <COL N="0962B"></COL> conversantur, sex diebus est consummatus; quibus
suppletis, benedictus est dies septimus; <NOTE N="oo" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  illi scil.  <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  ille.</NOTE>  ille
scilicet superventurus sabbati aeterni. In his itaque
diebus ab initio, non tantum diabolo et angelis
 <NOTE N="pp" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  erit.</NOTE>  ejus, sed et omnibus peccatoribus a Deo ignis est
praeparatus. In cujus flamma uri ille Finaeus dives
 <NOTE N="qq" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  ab initio,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et deest</HI>  Finaeus.</NOTE>  ab ipso Dei Filio est demonstratus. Hic est <NOTE N="rr" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Gehenna.</NOTE>  gehennae
ignis; in cujus <NOTE N="ss" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  similitudinem.</NOTE>  similitudine caminus imperio
regis septies tantum incensus per XL et IX
cubita <NOTE N="tt" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  exercuit.</NOTE>  excrevit, et adversarios Ananiae, Azariae
et Misahel consumpsit, et <NOTE N="uu" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  ipsus . . puerus . . . protectus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">et deest</HI>  a.</NOTE>  ipsos tres pueros a
Dei Filio protectos (in mysterio nostro qui sumus tertium
genus <NOTE N="vv" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  hominum.</NOTE>  hominum), non vexavit, <NOTE N="xx" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  impletis.</NOTE>  suppletis
itaque XLIX annis, post <NOTE N="yy" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  captivitatem.</NOTE>  LXX captivitatis,
facti sunt anni <NOTE N="zz" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  CXIV.</NOTE>  CXIX. Qui CXIX anni conjunguntur
 <COL N="0962C"></COL> illis qui ab Exodo usque ad Jechoniam
computati sunt anni DCCCCXCV, et fiunt in se anni
usque ad Hierusalem restitutam, suppleta septima
septimana, <NOTE N="aaa" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  anni.</NOTE>  anni I CXIIII.</P> <P COM="0962">Septima <NOTE N="bbb" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  autem.</NOTE>  autem septimana suppleta, necesse est
nos ad <NOTE N="ccc" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  LXXII.</NOTE>  LXII <NOTE N="ddd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> hebdomas.</NOTE>  hebdomades <NOTE N="eee" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0962" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0962D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  reverti.</NOTE>  converti: quae
continent annos CCCCXXXIV. Quibus suppletis
oportuit Christum secundum carnem nasci. De quo
 <COL N="0963A"></COL> <NOTE TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES ED="Dodwellus, Henricus" COM="0963"><COL N="0963D"></COL> <P COM="0963"><HI REND="ITALIC">De quo in continenti Simeon.</HI>  C.  <HI REND="ITALIC">contenentissimus.</HI> 
U.  <HI REND="ITALIC">continentissimus.</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>nounecevstatoû</FOREIGN> , pro quo interpres,
si forte fuerit interpres, legerat  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>sunecevstatoû</FOREIGN> . G. immo
 <HI REND="ITALIC">contentissimus,</HI>  ut sorte sua contentus: et Simeon
ipse dixit,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Domine, nunc dimittis servum tuum in pace,
quoniam oculi,</HI>  etc.</P> 

 <P COM="0963"><HI REND="ITALIC">Qui dies. W.</HI>  Nativitatem Christi, contra receptam
sententiam conjicit in martii diem XXVIII: nisi forte,
quae de nativitate dicit sint de conceptione intelligenda;
quae circa hoc tempus contigisse creditur,
 <COL N="0964D"></COL> nempe mart. XXV.</P> 

 <P COM="0964"><HI REND="ITALIC">Pars quarta diei habet tres horas. W.</HI>  Immo sex horas:
nam hic agitur de die 24 horarum, nisi vel
totum  <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>nucqhvmeron</FOREIGN>  divisum velit in 12 horas (nostrarum
duplas), vel tres horas diurnas, velit a totidem
nocturnis distinguere, quarum hic nullam rationem
habeat.</P> 

 <P COM="0964"><HI REND="ITALIC">Per quatuor tempora. W.</HI>  id est, quatuor vicibus,
seu quater.</P></NOTE>   <NOTE N="a" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  contenentissimus.</NOTE>  in continenti Simeon, vir justus, portans eum
 <NOTE N="b" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  manibus suis.</NOTE>  suis manibus, dixit ad Mariam matrem ejus: «Ecce
hic positus est in casum et resurrectionem <NOTE N="c" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">W. sic rescribo. C. et R.</HI>  mortuorum.</NOTE>  multorum
in Israel, et in signum cui <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  contradicitur.</NOTE>  contradicetur.»
Non tantum autem Simeon, sed et ipsi <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  CCCCXXIV.</NOTE>  CCCCXXX
et IV anni, et signum crucis, et tempus passionis,
et tertium diem resurrectionis ejus demonstraverunt.
 <NOTE N="f" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  Quo autem quo modo.</NOTE>  Quo autem modo videamus. Superius enim diximus
Abrahae centenario natum filium in mysterio
Christi; et demonstravimus neminem in Israel benedictionem
consecutum, aut nunc modo posse benedictionem
consequi, nisi in semine ipsius Abrahae,
qui est <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Christi.</NOTE>  Christus. Et ideo in sacramento Christi
 <NOTE N="h" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  CCCCXXXVII anni.</NOTE>  de CCCCXXXIV annis primo segregantur centum,
et remanent <NOTE N="i" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  CCCXXXVII.</NOTE>  CCCXXXIV. <NOTE N="j" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Trecentis.</NOTE>  Anni CCC scilicet
 <COL N="0963B"></COL> ostenderunt <NOTE N="k" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  crucis signum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">omisso</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>t.</FOREIGN>   <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>t</FOREIGN>  Tau signum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">omisso</HI> 
crucis.</NOTE>   <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>t</FOREIGN>  crucis signum, et remanserunt
XXXIV: <NOTE N="l" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  ex.</NOTE>  de quibus deductis <NOTE N="m" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  tres.</NOTE>  III, propter
 <NOTE N="n" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  diem.</NOTE>  diem resurrectionis ejus, remanserunt anni <NOTE N="o" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  XXXIII.</NOTE>  XXXI.
Quibus suppletis, oportuit propter peccata credentium
pati Christum. <NOTE N="p" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  his enim igitur.</NOTE>  Ipsos igitur <NOTE N="q" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  CCCXXXIV.</NOTE>  CCCCXXXIV
annos adjiciamus ad summam superiorem, et
inveniamus annos ab Exodo usque ad nativitatem
 <NOTE N="r" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Domini.</NOTE>  Christi, <NOTE N="s" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>   <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0040963A" TEXT="[Symbol]"></ORNAMENT>  DXXXVIII.</NOTE>  mille DXLVIII. Cujus nativitatis
tempus cognoscere desiderantes, ipsos annos
MDXLVIII ab Exodo, <NOTE N="t" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  id est a primo pinacis versu.</NOTE>  id est a primo pinacis versu,
diligenter <NOTE N="u" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  Dinumeramus.</NOTE>  dinumeremus, et ad diem nativitatis
ejus perveniemus. Qui dies sexta <NOTE N="v" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  sedecennitas.</NOTE>  sedecennitate
in tertio decimo versu invenitur, <NOTE N="x" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  V kl. April. feria IV.</NOTE>  V kl. april.
feria IV.</P> <P COM="0963">O quam praeclara et divina Domini providentia!
 <COL N="0964A"></COL> <NOTE N="y" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0963" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0963D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  ut in illo die quo factus est sol, in ipso die
nasceretur Christus, V kl. april. feria IV; et ideo de ipso.</NOTE>  ut in illo die quo factus est sol, in ipso die nasceretur
Christus, V kl. apr. feria IV, Et ideo de
ipso <NOTE N="z" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  merito.</NOTE>  merito ad plebem dicebat Malachias propheta:
«Orietur vobis sol justitiae, et curatio est
in <NOTE N="aa" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  pinnis.</NOTE>  pennis ejus.» Hic est sol justitiae cujus in
 <NOTE N="bb" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  pinnis ejus cujus ostendebatur.</NOTE>  pennis curatio praeostendebatur. De quo et Moyses
in cantico <NOTE N="cc" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  cognoscitur.</NOTE>  recognoscitur dicens: «Et super <NOTE N="dd" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  populum suum concupivit.</NOTE>  pullos
suos concupivit <NOTE N="ee" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  spandens alas.</NOTE>  et expandens alas suas.» Ipse
est Dominus in cujus <NOTE N="ff" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  similitudinem.</NOTE>  similitudine hic sol annuus
per CCCLXV <NOTE N="gg" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  dies.</NOTE>  dies et quartam partem <NOTE N="hh" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  dies.</NOTE>  diei
consummat. Quae ipsa quidem pars quarta diei habet
tres horas. Tres autem horae imaginem portant illorum
trium dierum qui in principio saeculi sine sole et
luna <NOTE N="ii" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  factus sunt.</NOTE>  fuerunt. Et ideo, <NOTE N="jj" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. deest</HI>  quomodo.</NOTE>  quomodo tres horae
in <NOTE N="kk" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  quadriennium.</NOTE>  quadriennio quater computatae unum diem duodecim
 <COL N="0964B"></COL> horarum <NOTE N="ll" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  efficiunt; ut et ipsae III horae diem.</NOTE>  effecerunt, sic et ipsi tres dies,
per quatuor tempora ternos menses sibi <NOTE N="mm" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C. et R.</HI>  defendentes.  <HI REND="ITALIC">G.</HI>  dependentes.</NOTE>  defendentes,
annum post XII menses suppletum demonstraverunt
 <NOTE N="nn" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  dinumeraverunt.</NOTE> . Et sic, per hanc multiformem trinitatem, et
ipse <NOTE N="oo" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  duodecim.</NOTE>  duodecim horae Evangelium unum in quatuor
partes divisum ostenderunt, <NOTE N="pp" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  aeterni,  <HI REND="ITALIC">forte</HI>  et terni.</NOTE>  et tres menses
per quatuor tempora, id est per quatuor <NOTE N="qq" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  evangelistas, electos a Christo XII Apostolos</NOTE>  Evangelia,
a Christo <NOTE N="rr" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  electus Apostolus.</NOTE>  electos XII Apostolos nobis <NOTE N="ss" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  manifestaverunt.</NOTE>  demonstraverunt.</P> <P COM="0964">Hi sunt Apostoli, quorum sermonibus aedificati, recognovimus
Dominum nostrum anno <NOTE N="tt" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  XV.</NOTE>  sextodecimo
imperii Tiberii Caesaris passum, cum esset ipse <NOTE N="uu" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  anno.</NOTE>  annorum
 <NOTE N="vv" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  XXX et uno.</NOTE>  XXXI. Ad <NOTE N="xx" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">C.</HI>  XV.</NOTE>  XVI ergo <NOTE N="yy" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R. deest</HI>  annum et.</NOTE>  annum et XXXI,
adjiciamus XVIII in nomine ipsius Jesu, et fit numerus
LXV; <NOTE N="zz" TYPE="Lectiones Variantes" ANCHORED=Y COM="0964" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0964D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">R.</HI>  quibus CCC.</NOTE>  quibus desunt trecenti ut impleatur annus
